%%{ c4: container }%%
graph TB

    Person(User, "Northstar User")

    subgraph Northstar {
        Container(Frontend, "Frontend", "React / TypeScript", "Financial dashboard and user interface")

        Container(Backend, "Backend API", "Python / FastAPI", "Application logic and financial planning")

        ContainerDb(DB, "PostgreSQL", "PostgreSQL", "Persistent user and financial data")
    }

    User -->|Interacts with| Frontend

    Frontend -->|HTTPS / REST API| Backend

    Backend -->|Reads and writes| DB
